OL,3,GNEWSABoy stabbed pupil with limited
OL,4,Aforce, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA masked schoolboy who stabbed a
OL,7,Fteenage girl could not have intended to
OL,8,Fkill her because he had used "limited
OL,9,Fforce" with the knife, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FNorfolk Police was called to Thorpe St
OL,13,FAndrew School, near Norwich, on 11
OL,14,FMarch following reports a 15-year-old
OL,15,Fhad been stabbed in the back.
OL,17,FThe defendant, who is 16 and cannot be
OL,18,Fnamed for legal reasons, denies
OL,19,Fattempted murder, but has admitted
OL,20,Fpossessing a kitchen knife without
OL,21,Flawful authority and wounding with
OL,22,Fintent.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
