OL,3,GNEWSABoy stabbed pupil with limited
OL,4,Aforce, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Rose KC, defending, told the
OL,7,Fjury at King's Lynn Crown Court there
OL,8,Fwere no other "sensible explanations"
OL,9,Ffor why the blade did not "penetrate
OL,10,Ffurther into [the victim's] body".
